<TMU|<tuple|1.1.0|2026.3.0>>

<style|<tuple|generic|chinese|table-captions-above|number-europe|preview-ref>>

<\body>
  假设我们有 <math|k> 次回声：

  <\equation*>
    y<around*|[|n|]>=x<around*|[|n|]>+\<alpha\><rsub|1>x<around*|[|n-N<rsub|1>|]>+\<cdots\>+\<alpha\><rsub|k>x<around*|[|n-N<rsub|k>|]>
  </equation*>

  考虑令 <math|E<around*|[|n|]>=y<around*|[|n|]>-x<around*|[|n|]>,<space|1em>x<around*|[|n-N<rsub|k>|]>=x<rsub|k><around*|[|n|]>>，则：

  <\equation*>
    E<around*|[|n|]>=<big|sum><rsub|i=1><rsup|k>\<alpha\><rsub|i> x<rsub|i><around*|[|n|]>
  </equation*>

  由图像中的峰值很容易知道 <math|N<rsub|k>>，那么 <math|x<rsub|k><around*|[|n|]>> 是已知的，现在的问题是怎么求 <math|\<alpha\><rsub|k>>。

  注意到，这实际上是一个线性方程组，即：

  <\equation*>
    <bmatrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|2|2|1|4|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|4|4|1|4|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      x<rsub|1><around*|[|1|]>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      x<rsub|2><around*|[|1|]>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<ldots\>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      x<rsub|k><around*|[|1|]>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      x<rsub|1><around*|[|2|]>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      x<rsub|2><around*|[|2|]>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<ldots\>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      x<rsub|k><around*|[|2|]>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<vdots\>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<vdots\>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<ddots\>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<vdots\>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      x<rsub|1><around*|[|n|]>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      x<rsub|2><around*|[|n|]>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<ldots\>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      x<rsub|k><around*|[|n|]>
    </cell>>>>><bmatrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      \<alpha\><rsub|1>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<alpha\><rsub|2>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<vdots\>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<alpha\><rsub|k>
    </cell>>>>>=<bmatrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      E<around*|[|1|]>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      E<around*|[|2|]>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<vdots\>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      E<around*|[|n|]>
    </cell>>>>>
  </equation*>

  令 <math|A=<bmatrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|2|2|1|4|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|4|4|1|4|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
    x<rsub|1><around*|[|1|]>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    x<rsub|2><around*|[|1|]>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    \<ldots\>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    x<rsub|k><around*|[|1|]>
  </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
    x<rsub|1><around*|[|2|]>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    x<rsub|2><around*|[|2|]>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    \<ldots\>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    x<rsub|k><around*|[|2|]>
  </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
    \<vdots\>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    \<vdots\>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    \<ddots\>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    \<vdots\>
  </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
    x<rsub|1><around*|[|n|]>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    x<rsub|2><around*|[|n|]>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    \<ldots\>
  </cell>|<\cell>
    x<rsub|k><around*|[|n|]>
  </cell>>>>>>，则 <math|\<alpha\>=A<rsup|-1>E>，对应 Matlab 中<with|font-series|bold|求线性方程组的最小二乘解>：

  <\cpp-code>
    alpha = A \\ E;
  </cpp-code>
</body>

